      "bottom": 0.6848888888888889,
      "top": 0.716
    },
    {
      "page": 1,
      "text": "357 prefetched and used\nin both policies.\nAccess-only reads are now\ncovered by Conservative.",
      "left": 0.38299999999999995,
      "right": 0.57971875,
      "bottom": 0.5356666666666667,
      "top": 0.655
    },
    {
      "page": 1,
      "text": "RecipePantry",
      "left": 0.6830000000000002,
      "right": 0.8131562500000001,
      "bottom": 0.6848888888888889,
      "top": 0.716
    },
    {
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Coverage remains lower:\n31.10% vs. 67.07%.\nUnknown origins / later\ncheckpoints are still gaps.",
      "left": 0.6830000000000002,
      "right": 0.8755781250000001,
      "bottom": 0.5356666666666667,
      "top": 0.655
    },
    {
      "page": 1,
      "text": "24 fresh workflows  \u2022  3 apps  \u2022  n = 3 per policy  \u2022  GIL-off threads",
      "left": 0.07,
      "right": 0.792578125,
      "bottom": 0.2877777777777778,
      "top": 0.32
    },
    {
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Conservative includes the new Access-demand implementation.\n\u201c832\u201d is a confirmed lower bound, not an exhaustive minimal-read oracle.",
      "left": 0.06,
      "right": 0.64171875,
      "bottom": 0.16244444444444442,
      "top": 0.22
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Define \u201cunnecessary\u201d at the payload boundary",
      "left": 0.055,
      "right": 0.72484375,
      "bottom": 0.8705555555555555,
      "top": 0.915
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "text": "A node need not be visited to be useful; a node can be accessed and still be avoidably fetched.",
      "left": 0.055,
      "right": 0.720859375,
      "bottom": 0.8217777777777778,
      "top": 0.844
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "text": "TTG  /  Access & Visit  /  2026-11-10  /  source-bound precision study",
      "left": 0.055,
      "right": 0.38328125,
      "bottom": 0.028333333333333332,
      "top": 0.045
    },
    {
