    {
      "page": 8,
      "text": "The root-excluded view changes only the denominator; it does not erase business misses.\nAggressive has 3 confirmed filter-only cooked Meal prefetches in ShoppingList, despite zero unused\nprefetches. Conservative still has substantially lower coverage, not a universal precision advantage.",
