      "bottom": 0.22733333333333333,
      "top": 0.254
    },
    {
      "page": 9,
      "text": "PlanMeal / CookMeal / BuyIngredient have no later prefetch submissions in these captures.\nA later ability entry can trigger prefetch, but an ordinary helper call is not a new ability entry.",
      "left": 0.06,
      "right": 0.711796875,
      "bottom": 0.102,
      "top": 0.15
